# For Model-Pipeline/Dockerfile only (Docker reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile in place of the
# repo's .dockerignore). Allowlist: only what the Dockerfile COPYs reaches the build. A new COPY needs a ! line.
*
!Data-Pipeline/requirements.txt
!Data-Pipeline/meridian.toml
!Model-Pipeline/requirements.txt
!Model-Pipeline/model.toml
!Model-Pipeline/data/features.parquet
!Model-Pipeline/data/features.schema.json
!Model-Pipeline/model/*.py
!Model-Pipeline/tests/*.py
